# Code quality

- Respect layer boundaries enforced by ESLint `boundaries/dependencies`:
  - `domain` → `domain`, `lib`
  - `engines` → `domain`, `engines`, `lib`
  - `storage` → `domain`, `storage`, `lib`
  - `workers` → `domain`, `engines`, `workers`
  - `features` → `domain`, `engines`, `storage`, `features`, `components`, `lib`
  - `components` → `domain`, `components`, `lib` (only `game-shell-client` may import `features`)
  - `app` → `components`, `lib`
- Do not add `useMemo` / `useCallback` / `React.memo` unless needed as an effect-dependency escape hatch. React Compiler (`reactCompiler: true`) handles memoization.
- Do not hand-edit `src/components/ui/**` except via the shadcn CLI / registry updates.
- Keep `bun run check` green: Biome format, Oxlint, ESLint, `tsc`, Knip, Vitest.
